{
  "title": "Nourishing Jamaican Callaloo Salad",
  "description": "A fermented, low-glycemic-friendly Jamaican dish featuring baby lettuce leaves, perfect for a hangover cure, served in a fondue pot. This salad is made with nigiri-shaping and shattering ingredients for a unique texture.",
  "cuisine": "Jamaican",
